  "content": "<p>如需此模組的資料包版本，請前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ffarmers-cutting-the-aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p><p>為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">天境</a>添加更多<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫樂事</a>的砧板配方</p><ul>\n<li>天根木的剝皮、回收與樹皮取得</li>\n<li>琥珀採集者可透過砧板剝取金橡木獲得黃金琥珀與樹皮\n<ul>\n<li>(Forge/NeoForge) 其他斧頭可剝取金橡木但僅獲得樹皮</li>\n<li>(Fabric) 其他斧頭無法在砧板上剝取金橡木</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>從可產出染料的花朵中獲得更多染料</li>\n<li>皮革手套可回收為（機率性）皮革</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/aether/media/woodcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"木材切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/aether/media/flowercutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"花朵切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/aether/media/leatherglovescutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"皮革手套切割\"></p><p>想要一次性獲得所有農夫切割內容？查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-cutting-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫切割合集</a>！</p>",
